1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 18]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:59,380
[Changsha Garrison Command]

4
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:02,680
[Inspector's Office]

5
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,130
Come in.

6
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,610
Sir.

7
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:11,260
By the authority granted to me through Hunan Police Secret Transfer Order

8
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,540
No. 47 under Provincial Garrison Command,

9
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,380
I am here to escort the suspected Japanese sympathizer.

10
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:17,340
Please stamp this

11
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,660
so that I can transfer the individual

12
00:02:19,750 --> 00:02:21,500
for further interrogation by the Military Justice Department.

13
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:31,740
[Suspected Japanese Sympathizer, Xie Jiu]

14
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:33,220
[Transfer immediately to Defense Headquarters. Provincial Garrison Command]

15
00:02:33,430 --> 00:02:35,260
Zhang Qishan sure has gone out of his way.

16
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,890
Go through the paperwork with him.

17
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:43,610
Three days later, your people

18
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,100
can come and take him away.

19
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:46,220
Sir.

20
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,500
The transfer order

21
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:50,220
says immediately.

22
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:52,220
Feel free to send a telegram

23
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:53,730
to Nanjing for further inquiries.

24
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,100
I am merely following the order given.

25
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,540
Bring him to the suspect.

26
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,100
Yes.

27
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,130
Thank you for your cooperation, sir.

28
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,940
You may leave now.

29
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:41,540
[Xie's Residence]

30
00:03:46,470 --> 00:03:47,130
Ninth Master,

31
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,570
you must have suffered a lot.

32
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:50,450
Master Zhang asked me to pick you up.

33
00:03:51,310 --> 00:03:52,690
Is Master Zhang okay?

34
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,100
We're heading to Beiping.

35
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,450
Third Master.

36
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,460
It's rare to see you here.

37
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,780
Fourth Master.

38
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,370
You have grown

39
00:04:21,390 --> 00:04:22,580
less vigilant.

40
00:04:23,870 --> 00:04:24,980
My ears

41
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:27,170
pick up footsteps very easily.

42
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,020
But in your case...

43
00:04:30,190 --> 00:04:31,340
Well, it's different.

44
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:37,700
Here.

45
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:38,700
[Express Ticket, Changsha to Beiping]

46
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,730
What is the meaning of this?

47
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:43,220
Master Zhang needs help in Beiping.

48
00:04:45,310 --> 00:04:47,810
When did you

49
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:49,290
become Master Zhang's lapdog?

50
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,140
What happened?

51
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,020
Your clan is no more?

52
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:53,930
And you're changing your family name to Zhang?

53
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,460
You heard what Master Zhang said.

54
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,050
The Japanese are here.

55
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,610
I don't want this place to be affected.

56
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,220
I want it to remain peaceful.

57
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,290
I knew it.

58
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,100
People with a family like you

59
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:08,900
are a burden.

60
00:05:09,870 --> 00:05:11,050
I'm a loner.

61
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:11,900
I can leave whenever.

62
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,630
I don't care if Changsha is affected or not.

63
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,020
You can leave.

64
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,980
But what about your master's wife?

65
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:21,100
It has been two years.

66
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,460
And you aren't even allowed to pay respect to her.

67
00:05:25,070 --> 00:05:25,900
I wish I could.

68
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:26,930
I don't know where Eryue Hong

69
00:05:26,950 --> 00:05:27,900
buried her.

70
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:28,810
How can I pay respect to her then?

71
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:31,810
I know where.

72
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:42,050
When do we depart?

73
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:46,340
The hour of Wu tomorrow.

74
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,580
We still have time.

75
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:53,250
Where are you going?

76
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,220
To catch some crabs.

77
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,100
Thank you, Third Master.

78
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:10,100
Newspaper! Newspaper!

79
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:10,900
[Fenjiu Liquor]

80
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,020
Bugger off.

81
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:20,850
Sixth Master.

82
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,290
I brought this excellent

83
00:06:24,390 --> 00:06:25,850
fenjiu liquor for you.

84
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,610
30 years old.

85
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,460
Don't you want to try it?

86
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,610
My posterior.

87
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:41,780
Divine.

88
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,490
Do you like it?

89
00:06:46,430 --> 00:06:47,220
It's good, isn't it?

90
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:48,850
Sixth Master.

91
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:50,100
I came

92
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,850
with a message from Master Zhang.

93
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,220
He needs your help

94
00:06:54,390 --> 00:06:55,610
in Beiping.

95
00:06:57,630 --> 00:06:58,340
How much?

96
00:06:59,000 --> 00:06:59,660
How much?

97
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:01,780
It's unpaid.

98
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,730
No, thanks.

99
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,290
Sixth Master,

100
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,810
you're close with Master Zhang.

101
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,810
Let's not measure the relationship with money.

102
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:10,780
I'm not going.

103
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,490
Sixth Master.

104
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,370
That's all I have.

105
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,140
Tiezui.

106
00:07:31,070 --> 00:07:32,340
Your business is failing.

107
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:34,810
This

108
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,290
isn't even enough to buy two pots of liquor.

109
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,250
Sixth Master.

110
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,810
You took my money. That means you're coming.

111
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,580
I'm not coming.

112
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:48,290
Give it back then.

113
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,850
Sixth Master,

114
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,490
I know we hardly talk.

115
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,290
But as part of the Mystic Nine,

116
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,580
we always know the right thing to do.

117
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,290
I'm not close to Laogou.

118
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,780
I don't care

119
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:11,220
if he lives or dies.

120
00:08:12,390 --> 00:08:13,170
The Mystic Nine is old.

121
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,580
It's time for some changes.

122
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,340
If he's dead,

123
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,340
I can nominate another candidate.

124
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,660
Sixth Master.

125
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,140
Have I not made myself clear enough?

126
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,930
Follow me

127
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,020
and your scarf isn't the only thing cut in half.

128
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:54,420
No wonder I couldn't convince him.

129
00:08:55,870 --> 00:08:58,770
Only women can move that soul.

130
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:06,100
[Divination Service]

131
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:07,980
Stay away

132
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,220
from that kind of thing.

133
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:10,370
It's not good for your health.

134
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,010
Don't worry, Master Zhang.

135
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:13,730
I am fine.

136
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:14,730
Fine?

137
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,580
You

138
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:17,850
are pallid.

139
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,220
Master Zhang?

140
00:09:23,270 --> 00:09:24,130
Xie Jiu?

141
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:32,530
Why are you here?

142
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,220
Xie Jiu.

143
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:41,220
I'm so glad you've been freed.

144
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,730
Huo Wenhai

145
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,420
has set his eyes on my house.

146
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:48,580
Xie Jiu and I are departing soon.

147
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,300
We dropped by to check on you.

148
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,300
Have you talked to Chen Pi and Heibei?

149
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,980
Li

150
00:09:55,030 --> 00:09:56,100
went to talk to Chen Pi.

151
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,420
As for Heibei...

152
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,420
You can count on me.

153
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,730
My divination said that this trip

154
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,370
would be a good trip.

155
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:10,490
The wealth line is dim,

156
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,730
but as long as we have enough money,

157
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,820
it will be a fruitful trip, Master Zhang.

158
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,180
Ninth Master.

159
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:20,300
Here.

160
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,100
Everyone knows that the auction

161
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,060
in Xinyue Restaurant is an avatar of avarice.

162
00:10:28,550 --> 00:10:30,490
Many have squandered away their wealth

163
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,530
to be famous there.

164
00:10:32,870 --> 00:10:33,820
Without enough money,

165
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,580
our trip will be in vain.

166
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:39,180
The Ministry of War is watching me closely.

167
00:10:39,510 --> 00:10:40,370
I cannot do much.

168
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,580
I've leveraged the cash,

169
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:42,820
the gold,

170
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,220
and the deeds

171
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,340
I have,

172
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:46,890
but they are not enough.

173
00:10:48,030 --> 00:10:48,980
I have mobilized

174
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,980
every asset I have too.

175
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,130
If it's anything like the last time,

176
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,980
it's still far from enough.

177
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,610
This is what I've been saying.

178
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:00,530
Where

179
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,940
are we supposed to find a rich,

180
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,340
foolish person to help us?

181
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,130
Right?

182
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,250
At this point,

183
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,770
we have to raise funds among ourselves.

184
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,700
In Changsha,

185
00:11:14,550 --> 00:11:15,980
the Mystic Nine

186
00:11:16,870 --> 00:11:18,180
is the most affluent.

187
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,100
If we all

188
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:22,580
pool our money together,

189
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,420
it won't be a problem.

190
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,370
Xie Jiu's idea is great, Master Zhang.

191
00:11:27,670 --> 00:11:28,220
Look.

192
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:29,890
Hong, Li, and Xiangu,

193
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,130
can all contribute a little.

194
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,100
Well, you already know my situation.

195
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:36,180
I spent all my money last time

196
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,220
in Xinyue Restaurant.

197
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,940
I'm penniless now.

198
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:45,250
Tiezui.

199
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,100
I know

200
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,700
life

201
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:49,700
can be tough.

202
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:50,700
You know what?

203
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,300
If you

204
00:11:52,630 --> 00:11:53,610
no longer have a place to stay,

205
00:11:54,910 --> 00:11:55,890
you can stay with me.

206
00:11:57,670 --> 00:11:58,940
You can also stay with me.

207
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:06,770
Let's go there.

208
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:07,820
[Zuiyue Pleasure House]
You haven't come here for a while.

209
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:09,340
Exactly. I've missed you.

210
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:10,850
[Zuiyue Pleasure House]
I've been busy.

211
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:12,340
- Come in. - Quick. Come in.

212
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:48,410
Where are you going to change your habit

213
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:50,180
of climbing through the window?

214
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,300
I'll have to pay if I enter through the entrance.

215
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,700
I finally earned some coins.

216
00:12:57,030 --> 00:12:58,530
If I give them away, I won't be able to afford you.

217
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:08,620
[Ms. Bai]

218
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,770
I'll go inside to rest up.

219
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:31,250
I've already paid up. Why can't I go inside?

220
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:34,130
Are you trying to say it's over between us?

221
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,530
You're not sleeping here today.

222
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:48,530
Because you have a place you should visit.

223
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:56,460
Did that seer come here to talk to you?

224
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:01,610
Where are you going?

225
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:03,220
To kill him.

226
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:05,000
There are many seers in Changsha.

227
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,890
Can you kill them all?

228
00:14:07,510 --> 00:14:08,650
Eighth Master never fools around

229
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:10,650
with his divination.

230
00:14:12,510 --> 00:14:13,650
If he says you should go,

231
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,370
you must go.

232
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:20,220
I don't care about his divination.

233
00:14:21,030 --> 00:14:22,460
This is no longer a personal matter.

234
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,220
Fifth Master,

235
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,650
that peculiar tower,

236
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:27,580
and the Japanese inside.

237
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,060
If what he said is true,

238
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:33,010
the entire Changsha

239
00:14:34,030 --> 00:14:35,010
will be affected.

240
00:14:35,550 --> 00:14:36,820
I don't care.

241
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:38,940
The world is in chaos.

242
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:40,890
I'm too lazy to care.

243
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,890
Then, don't show your face here anymore.

244
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:54,100
So you've decided

245
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,130
to side with Zhang Qishan today.

246
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,370
The world forced me to make this decision.

247
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,420
No one had a choice.

248
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:21,300
Help Zhang Qishan

249
00:15:22,510 --> 00:15:23,700
and this world will have

250
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:26,580
fewer people who have to commodify themselves as I did.

251
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:32,530
If you return alive,

252
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:34,490
I'll leave with you.

253
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:36,460
We'll go wherever you want.

254
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:38,650
I won't stay here.

255
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,060
I'll stay at our home.

256
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:49,320
[Pear Garden]

257
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:49,820
Sanshui,

258
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:52,300
give Master Zhang

259
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,420
all the money and deeds

260
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,100
I have.

261
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:56,850
Master, this is...

262
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:57,530
Now.

263
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:58,610
Yes.

264
00:16:02,510 --> 00:16:03,100
Second Master.

265
00:16:04,670 --> 00:16:06,490
You're giving everything you have.

266
00:16:07,670 --> 00:16:10,420
Master Zhang spent all his money to save Yatou back then.

267
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,420
It'll be ungrateful of me

268
00:16:13,030 --> 00:16:13,850
to not do the same

269
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:15,610
when Master Zhang needs my help.

270
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:16,770
Besides,

271
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:20,530
we're up against the Japanese now.

272
00:16:26,790 --> 00:16:27,370
Eighth Master.

273
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,460
Okay.

274
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:35,940
Third Master.

275
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:45,300
Ticket, please.

276
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:46,390
[Changsha Station]

277
00:16:46,390 --> 00:16:46,820
Here.

278
00:16:47,150 --> 00:16:47,850
Okay. Go inside.

279
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:49,730
All right.

280
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:50,730
Come.

281
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:51,890
Master Zhang.

282
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:53,800
While we have raised

283
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:54,980
1.94 million silver coins,

284
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,730
if things don't go smoothly

285
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,700
in Xinyue Restaurant,

286
00:16:59,870 --> 00:17:01,130
it might still not be enough.

287
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:02,770
We're out of options.

288
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,010
Let's cross the bridge when we get there.

289
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:11,140
Tiezui.

290
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:16,380
Where is he?

291
00:17:18,270 --> 00:17:19,090
On the way.

292
00:17:19,270 --> 00:17:20,090
He'll be here soon.

293
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:22,180
Are you sure?

294
00:17:25,110 --> 00:17:25,770
I'm not sure.

295
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:28,900
Quick.

296
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,180
Quick.

297
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,250
Over here.

298
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,010
We all want different things.

299
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:34,770
I can't force him.

300
00:17:36,270 --> 00:17:38,940
You can never count on Tiezui anyway.

301
00:17:39,590 --> 00:17:40,180
Chen Pi!

302
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,420
Master Zhang.

303
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:54,140
Sixth Master!

304
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:56,460
Finally, you're here, Sixth Master.

305
00:17:57,030 --> 00:17:57,940
You're here.

306
00:17:58,310 --> 00:18:00,050
If you come a second later, the train will depart.

307
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,250
How righteous of you.

308
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:06,290
Let's find out if people are more generous towards a beggar in Beiping.

309
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:07,810
Sixth Master.

310
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:08,810
Thank you.

311
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,860
As stubborn as a donkey.

312
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:15,660
I heard Tiezui went to Ms. Bai.

313
00:18:16,070 --> 00:18:17,770
One word from that old pimp

314
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:19,290
and you changed your mind.

315
00:18:19,790 --> 00:18:21,290
Would you like to die to my blade?

316
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,140
Come. Bring it on.

317
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:24,460
- Sixth Master. - Enough.

318
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:25,700
I'd like to remind you

319
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,250
that there are many Japanese citizens

320
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:28,700
and spies in Beiping.

321
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,090
Anything involving the Japanese

322
00:18:30,350 --> 00:18:32,490
will go through the Embassy of Japan.

323
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:35,700
They even established a cultural center

324
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:37,860
to rewrite history and misappropriate cultural relics.

325
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:40,810
The center is under the Japanese Ministry of Foreign Affairs.

326
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:43,180
And its man in charge is Torii Tottori.

327
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:45,700
The current Beiping

328
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,140
is not the Beiping we remember.

329
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,460
But regardless of the changes,

330
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,770
it is still Beiping of China.

331
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:57,290
Board the train. We'll have a meeting.

332
00:19:02,940 --> 00:19:11,780
[Changsha Station]

333
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:16,940
The Japanese influence

334
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:19,570
has reached deep into Beiping.

335
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:21,700
To maintain their stance, Xinyue Restaurant

336
00:19:22,350 --> 00:19:23,250
rents

337
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:25,380
venues from the Military Affairs Commission to hold the auction.

338
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,180
That way, the Japanese cannot interfere

339
00:19:28,360 --> 00:19:29,260
[Beiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission]
and cause trouble.

340
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:30,530
That's why the invitation letter

341
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,140
is very important.

342
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,180
My wife told me

343
00:19:34,510 --> 00:19:35,380
that the first invitation letter

344
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:37,380
was on the Chief Editor of Yahe Monthly,

345
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,460
Liang Bencai.

346
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,010
Yahe Monthly

347
00:19:40,010 --> 00:19:41,420
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]
is just a front sponsored by the Japanese.

348
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:43,940
Liang Bencai studies antiquities.

349
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:46,220
The Japanese used someone like him

350
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:48,770
to smuggle the Chinese antiquities back home.

351
00:19:49,110 --> 00:19:51,940
Master Zhang and I will disguise ourselves as Mantetsu agents.

352
00:19:52,270 --> 00:19:53,700
We will confiscate his invitation letter by claiming

353
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,180
that he is suspected of bribery.

354
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:57,220
Then, we will order him to stay put

355
00:19:57,310 --> 00:19:58,530
and never contact the outside world.

356
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:00,250
If he doesn't believe you and resists?

357
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:01,570
It has to work.

358
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,490
[Yahe Monthly]
Otherwise, we'll be wanted city-wide.

359
00:20:04,070 --> 00:20:05,250
Yahe Monthly Publishing House

360
00:20:05,250 --> 00:20:06,570
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]
is situated in the center of the Japanese Residential Area.

361
00:20:06,830 --> 00:20:08,290
There are 8,400 guards in the vicinity.

362
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:10,940
Our operation has to be successful.

363
00:20:11,830 --> 00:20:12,700
The second invitation letter

364
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:14,140
is on a Jiangxi native

365
00:20:14,830 --> 00:20:16,460
called Xiong Lichang.

366
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,860
[Zhengyang Pavilion]
He lives in Zhengyang Pavilion.

367
00:20:20,070 --> 00:20:23,380
Chen Pi, Heibei, you'll be in charge of him.

368
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,490
Get his invitation letter

369
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,180
and impersonate him.

370
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:29,660
Master Zhang.

371
00:20:30,070 --> 00:20:31,420
You have assigned the task to the rest.

372
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:33,290
What about Stinky Yu and me?

373
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:34,860
You two will just take the money.

374
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,420
We'll operate separately.

375
00:20:41,310 --> 00:20:42,250
You were imprisoned for a long time.

376
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,980
Have you found the answer to the question

377
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,490
that has been bothering you?

378
00:20:48,790 --> 00:20:49,660
How do you know

379
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:50,860
I've been thinking about it?

380
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,490
It is a tough question

381
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,770
to answer.

382
00:20:56,070 --> 00:20:56,660
Indeed.

383
00:20:58,350 --> 00:20:59,250
I've been thinking,

384
00:21:00,310 --> 00:21:01,490
the time is changing.

385
00:21:02,350 --> 00:21:03,660
The Mystic Nine has survived this long.

386
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,090
What does our future lead to?

387
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,530
Do you want to hear my answer?

388
00:21:11,310 --> 00:21:13,140
It doesn't matter if our future is bright or gloomy.

389
00:21:14,070 --> 00:21:15,570
In this transformative era,

390
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:17,860
there are only two possible outcomes.

391
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:19,980
One,

392
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:21,660
you march forward.

393
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:23,330
Two,

394
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:25,420
you're sacrificed in the name of evolution.

395
00:21:26,830 --> 00:21:27,660
I want to know

396
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:29,940
what we will choose.

397
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:33,530
Our choices

398
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:35,940
depend on our personalities.

399
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:37,090
No.

400
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,570
It's not a choice at all.

401
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:42,220
Our destiny dictates

402
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,770
if we survive or if we are sacrificed.

403
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,220
I don't believe in destiny.

404
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,220
Tiezui said

405
00:21:52,590 --> 00:21:53,220
he could never predict

406
00:21:53,590 --> 00:21:54,380
my fate accurately.

407
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,980
Well, I'm not too worried

408
00:21:59,030 --> 00:22:00,330
about those who sacrifice themselves.

409
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,730
We, as a nation,

410
00:22:03,510 --> 00:22:04,700
are never lacking

411
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:05,900
in brave, selfless souls.

412
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,050
Time after time,

413
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,460
history has proven

414
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,250
that those who invaded our land

415
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:15,140
always underestimated our sacrifices and resilience.

416
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,770
I'm more worried

417
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:22,180
about the ones who march forward.

418
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:24,860
With so many

419
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,980
sacrificed lives on their shoulders,

420
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:29,900
their journey will be lonely.

421
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:31,330
Very lonely.

422
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,490
If you take the path for long enough,

423
00:22:34,510 --> 00:22:35,810
you no longer feel lonely.

424
00:22:38,350 --> 00:22:39,530
If a war breaks out,

425
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,330
I will be there at the defense line

426
00:22:43,310 --> 00:22:44,250
and never back down.

427
00:22:48,940 --> 00:22:52,540
[Beiping]

428
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:57,110
[Station Exit]

429
00:22:57,110 --> 00:22:58,620
Breaking news!

430
00:22:58,720 --> 00:23:01,860
Stabbed in public. Attacker is still at large.

431
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:03,380
Breaking news!

432
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,290
- Attacker is still at large. - Newsboy.

433
00:23:07,260 --> 00:23:09,140
[Judge Shen of High Court Stabbed, Attacker is Still At Large]

434
00:23:09,140 --> 00:23:10,620
[Shot thrice]

435
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:12,250
Breaking news!

436
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:13,880
Judge Shen of High Court

437
00:23:13,880 --> 00:23:15,430
- stabbed in public. - Proceed with the plan.

438
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,180
Attacker is still at large.

439
00:23:17,820 --> 00:23:21,980
[Yahe Monthly]

440
00:23:30,270 --> 00:23:31,290
Has the budget been approved?

441
00:23:34,260 --> 00:23:35,110
[Chief Editor's Office]

442
00:23:35,110 --> 00:23:35,620
Chief Editor,

443
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:38,250
our budget this time is only half

444
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:39,660
of our previous budget.

445
00:23:39,700 --> 00:23:42,550
[Liang Bencai]

446
00:23:42,550 --> 00:23:42,940
Half?

447
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:47,490
That won't be enough to get us a private cabin.

448
00:23:49,590 --> 00:23:50,250
What is happening?

449
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:51,290
I have no idea.

450
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:57,220
Did they find someone new

451
00:23:57,270 --> 00:23:59,050
to help them with the auction?

452
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,180
The Japanese

453
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,090
blow hot

454
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:06,180
and cold.

455
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,620
How are we supposed to work like that?

456
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:11,090
Chief Editor,

457
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,560
perhaps they noticed

458
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,730
what we did to the goods last time?

459
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:20,050
As if they could find out.

460
00:24:21,350 --> 00:24:22,290
If they did,

461
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,380
we wouldn't be alive now.

462
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:26,140
Get out.

463
00:24:26,340 --> 00:24:32,020
[Chief Editor's Office]

464
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:45,100
[Yahe Monthly Publishing House]

465
00:24:45,100 --> 00:24:46,180
[Agent ID]

466
00:24:47,260 --> 00:24:49,780
[Agent ID]

467
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:50,460
Sir,

468
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:52,140
according to our rules,

469
00:24:52,270 --> 00:24:54,460
you need to register your name and your unit.

470
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:55,980
It won't take long.

471
00:24:56,110 --> 00:24:56,810
Just a few notes will do.

472
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:57,730
Forgive us.

473
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:08,050
Which branch are you from?

474
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:15,770
[Sasaki]
Where are you from?

475
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:17,090
I'm asking you a question.

476
00:25:17,480 --> 00:25:18,220
What's taking you so long to answer?

477
00:25:18,510 --> 00:25:20,090
Receptionist, notify the guards outside.

478
00:25:20,270 --> 00:25:21,530
Frisk them and find out who they are.

479
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,250
Sasaki?

480
00:25:25,830 --> 00:25:28,140
You don't recognize me?

481
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,770
That summer in the Military Academy?

482
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:38,140
I'm so glad you're here in Beiping.

483
00:25:39,270 --> 00:25:41,140
Over there in Tianjin,

484
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:42,940
we have to check on the transport line all day long.

485
00:25:43,350 --> 00:25:46,200
They ask me to write 10 reports when I want a bit of coal.

486
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,420
It's unbelievable.

487
00:25:49,750 --> 00:25:50,250
Camel cigarettes.

488
00:25:51,110 --> 00:25:53,490
Plenty of them in the train.

489
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:59,460
You're doing so well now.

490
00:26:00,830 --> 00:26:02,570
Sorry, sir.

491
00:26:04,510 --> 00:26:06,180
Just an old friend of mine.

492
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:10,250
This is Officer Yamamoto from the Investigation Branch.

493
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:13,530
Hi, Officer Yamamoto.

494
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:19,220
We still have work to do.

495
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,620
We have to see someone at the publishing house

496
00:26:21,790 --> 00:26:23,900
to hand over an approved copy.

497
00:26:35,070 --> 00:26:36,940
Let's catch up another time.

498
00:26:43,070 --> 00:26:44,440
Who is he?

499
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:47,530
How come I don't remember him?

500
00:26:47,980 --> 00:26:48,780
[Yahe Monthly]

501
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,530
Master Zhang.

502
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:55,140
Pick up some Japanese if you can.

503
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:56,490
Just in case.

504
00:26:59,790 --> 00:27:02,010
Don't tell me the higher-up doesn't trust me.

505
00:27:03,270 --> 00:27:05,730
I can explain in person.

506
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:08,140
There must be a misunderstanding.

507
00:27:11,510 --> 00:27:12,380
Who are you?

508
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:16,570
Question him. I'll look around.

509
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:17,900
Yes.

510
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:24,010
I am from the Mantetsu Investigation Branch.

511
00:27:24,590 --> 00:27:25,860
Mr. Liang,

512
00:27:26,070 --> 00:27:29,290
I need to ask you something.

513
00:27:39,720 --> 00:27:40,460
Do you have a Letter of Introduction?

514
00:27:41,310 --> 00:27:43,050
You will not be entertained without an official document.

515
00:27:43,590 --> 00:27:47,140
I am the legal representative of a Japanese company.

516
00:27:48,070 --> 00:27:49,250
According to the agreement,

517
00:27:49,350 --> 00:27:51,220
I have exclusive jurisdiction over internal affairs.

518
00:27:51,590 --> 00:27:52,620
Do not touch that.

519
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:54,900
It belongs to the Empire of Japan.

520
00:28:01,070 --> 00:28:02,490
We know what you did

521
00:28:03,270 --> 00:28:05,570
to the previous batch of goods.

522
00:28:06,590 --> 00:28:07,420
We just need

523
00:28:08,030 --> 00:28:09,900
to find out if you're colluding with your superior.

524
00:28:11,070 --> 00:28:12,290
We aren't sure

525
00:28:13,350 --> 00:28:15,050
so we won't alert the rest yet.

526
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,770
I don't know what you're talking about.

527
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:24,140
The goods

528
00:28:25,750 --> 00:28:26,620
are still here.

529
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:28,380
Right?

530
00:28:32,750 --> 00:28:35,090
Maybe it can still be salvaged.

531
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,900
You either bring us the authentic goods,

532
00:28:38,720 --> 00:28:42,530
or tell us the mastermind

533
00:28:42,550 --> 00:28:43,700
behind you.

534
00:28:44,350 --> 00:28:47,330
Then, we might just keep you here.

535
00:28:52,880 --> 00:28:53,490
Really?

536
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:56,700
Therefore,

537
00:28:58,350 --> 00:28:59,290
we will confiscate

538
00:29:00,750 --> 00:29:02,810
your right to attend the auction in Xinyue Restaurant.

539
00:29:04,070 --> 00:29:05,570
We will attend it on your behalf.

540
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:07,980
To avoid drawing unnecessary attention,

541
00:29:08,550 --> 00:29:09,700
you should stay here.

542
00:29:10,830 --> 00:29:12,940
We will bid according to your protocol

543
00:29:13,200 --> 00:29:14,090
and submit the goods.

544
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,010
Understood?

545
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:17,940
I want to make a call.

546
00:29:20,160 --> 00:29:20,980
Sure.

547
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:24,220
You have two choices.

548
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:25,980
One.

549
00:29:26,640 --> 00:29:27,570
Make the call

550
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,900
and bring us the embezzled money.

551
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:31,660
Two.

552
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:35,570
Call your superior, Tottori.

553
00:29:36,310 --> 00:29:38,660
Ask him what you should do now.

554
00:29:40,830 --> 00:29:41,620
Mr. Liang,

555
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,620
surely you know

556
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:46,090
that your line is bugged.

557
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:49,010
Please don't make things more difficult for us.

558
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:02,810
Fine. Let's do as you wish.

559
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:07,460
One more thing.

560
00:30:08,750 --> 00:30:10,770
I need to use your car downstairs.

561
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:12,730
No problem.

562
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,700
And your attire.

563
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:18,660
Careful. It's hot.

564
00:30:18,720 --> 00:30:19,090
Okay.

565
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,420
Come.

566
00:30:21,830 --> 00:30:22,290
Master Zhang.

567
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:23,810
No extra spicy.

568
00:30:41,590 --> 00:30:43,050
We got the first invitation letter.

569
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:46,330
Things in Beiping are more tense than we imagined.

570
00:30:46,790 --> 00:30:48,290
We must be extra cautious.

571
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:49,940
Also, I need another favor

572
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:51,660
from all of you.

573
00:30:52,830 --> 00:30:53,420
Go ahead.

574
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,860
As you all know,

575
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:56,220
my wife

576
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,810
is from Xinyue Restaurant.

577
00:30:58,590 --> 00:30:59,770
You might assume that they

578
00:31:00,510 --> 00:31:01,490
will be more lenient to me.

579
00:31:02,550 --> 00:31:03,900
But to them,

580
00:31:04,350 --> 00:31:05,220
rules are rules.

581
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:07,530
I broke the biggest rule when I took

582
00:31:07,750 --> 00:31:08,570
Luhuo Grass last time.

583
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:10,980
My wife implored and begged them.

584
00:31:11,640 --> 00:31:13,330
Hence, they didn't hunt me down.

585
00:31:13,590 --> 00:31:15,380
But there is also a new rule now.

586
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:17,220
If I enter Xinyue Restaurant again,

587
00:31:17,350 --> 00:31:17,980
I'll be killed.

588
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:20,900
They must be joking.

589
00:31:22,270 --> 00:31:22,810
Joking?

590
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,220
Zhang Qishan.

591
00:31:24,220 --> 00:31:24,790
[To Zhang Qishan]

592
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:26,530
The greatest mercy I can afford

593
00:31:26,750 --> 00:31:28,900
is that you shall never enter Xinyue Restaurant again.

594
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:31,380
As the leader of the Mystic Nine,

595
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,810
I'm sure you are a man of your word.

596
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,420
If you enter

597
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:35,900
the restaurant again,

598
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:38,010
you're disrespecting the centuries of legacy we have.

599
00:31:38,960 --> 00:31:40,460
Our ally behind the scenes

600
00:31:40,510 --> 00:31:41,980
will not spare you.

601
00:31:42,750 --> 00:31:44,380
Their ally behind the scenes?

602
00:31:45,160 --> 00:31:46,180
Who are they?

603
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:47,490
I have no idea.

604
00:31:48,400 --> 00:31:49,900
Xinyue Restaurant has stood for centuries.

605
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:51,050
They are mysterious.

606
00:31:52,350 --> 00:31:53,860
So other than the Yin Clan who runs the place,

607
00:31:54,310 --> 00:31:55,860
Xinyue Restaurant also has support

608
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:56,810
behind the scenes.

609
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:58,380
If we barge in,

610
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:01,330
even your wife won't keep us alive.

611
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,570
And Mr. Yin will have no choice

612
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:04,810
but to kill me.

613
00:32:08,510 --> 00:32:09,140
Therefore,

614
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:11,490
we cannot blow our cover.

615
00:32:12,070 --> 00:32:12,980
Especially you.

616
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,980
The poisonous needles on the polearms will kill you immediately.

617
00:32:15,110 --> 00:32:15,940
There is no cure.

618
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,140
Your martial prowess

619
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:18,530
is not enough to save you.

620
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,660
We must do it flawlessly

621
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,140
to escape.

622
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:27,220
So, I'll die from one prick?

623
00:32:28,030 --> 00:32:28,810
Yes.

624
00:32:32,350 --> 00:32:34,090
Any other caveats, Master Zhang?

625
00:32:35,270 --> 00:32:35,980
Ear slaves

626
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:37,090
will be there to monitor the whole place.

627
00:32:37,200 --> 00:32:38,700
We'll speak in Changsha tongue.

628
00:32:40,790 --> 00:32:41,810
Let me reiterate.

629
00:32:42,270 --> 00:32:44,770
The second invitation letter is on a Jiangxi native

630
00:32:45,480 --> 00:32:47,220
called Xiong Lichang.

631
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:49,460
He lives in Zhengyang Pavilion.

632
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:52,140
Proceed with the plan.

633
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,530
Chen Pi, Heibei.

634
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:54,380
I count on you two.

635
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,770
Do not kill anyone unless you have to.

636
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:02,220
Master Zhang.

637
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,570
I can withdraw the money myself.

638
00:33:04,920 --> 00:33:06,380
Stinky Yu can assist Chen Pi and Heibei.

639
00:33:07,550 --> 00:33:08,620
We stick to the original plan.

640
00:33:10,640 --> 00:33:11,490
Let's get changed.

641
00:33:29,550 --> 00:33:30,570
Are you feeling better?

642
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,090
The new medicine this time

643
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,620
should be quite effective.

644
00:33:36,550 --> 00:33:38,660
You will be cured soon.

645
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:40,900
You're funny, Mr. Tottori.

646
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,940
Knowing you,

647
00:33:43,640 --> 00:33:44,770
my full recovery

648
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:47,140
will ruin your empire's plan.

649
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:49,940
It will not be cured

650
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:52,180
in the foreseeable future.

651
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:55,090
We, the Japanese, do not extort

652
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:57,220
our allies with diseases.

653
00:33:57,750 --> 00:33:58,660
We will

654
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,730
get what we're after eventually.

655
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:03,810
Using dirty tricks like this is beneath us.

656
00:34:08,190 --> 00:34:09,380
We shall see

657
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,380
if your doctors can cure me.

658
00:34:19,030 --> 00:34:19,900
You know

659
00:34:20,630 --> 00:34:21,900
that my gentleness toward you

660
00:34:23,280 --> 00:34:25,090
is not pure business.

661
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,610
Shouldn't you be afraid of the consequences?

662
00:34:29,510 --> 00:34:31,940
Your government has never been kind to soldiers

663
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,050
who mix work with pleasure.

664
00:34:35,550 --> 00:34:36,900
And I am willing

665
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:39,460
to serve the punishment.

666
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:42,780
Many men have told me the same thing.

667
00:34:45,110 --> 00:34:47,010
I don't need you to be the hopeless romantic.

668
00:34:47,590 --> 00:34:48,530
Let's

669
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,490
keep our relationship simple.

670
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:51,300
Sure.

671
00:34:52,230 --> 00:34:53,210
Let's keep it simple.

672
00:34:54,630 --> 00:34:55,610
I'll cure you.

673
00:34:56,670 --> 00:34:58,780
Then, you can choose what to do.

674
00:35:00,710 --> 00:35:01,780
I just don't want to see you

675
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:03,610
die from such a disease.

676
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:09,340
You'll have to work harder then, Mr. Tottori.

677
00:35:13,030 --> 00:35:15,300
I'm not done enjoying the air in Changsha.

678
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:18,340
I don't want to die in Beiping.

679
00:35:28,510 --> 00:35:29,010
Sir,

680
00:35:29,590 --> 00:35:31,940
why did Banjie Li ask to see you all of a sudden?

681
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,260
He is up to something.

682
00:35:36,360 --> 00:35:38,610
One moment, Zhang Qishan had Xie Jiu transferred away.

683
00:35:39,230 --> 00:35:40,300
The next moment,

684
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,570
Banjie Li's invitation letter

685
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:42,740
was on my desk.

686
00:35:43,070 --> 00:35:44,690
That's too much of a coincidence.

687
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:47,980
Have you found out

688
00:35:48,070 --> 00:35:49,650
where Zhang Qishan brought Xie Jiu?

689
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,050
I just received news

690
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:53,980
that Xie Jiu went to Beiping.

691
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:57,340
Zhang Qishan has not been seen in Changsha for the last few days either.

692
00:35:57,800 --> 00:35:58,610
One more thing,

693
00:35:58,920 --> 00:36:00,050
there will be an auction

694
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,740
in Xinyue Restaurant of Beiping soon.

695
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:06,530
Zhang Qishan.

696
00:36:07,480 --> 00:36:08,170
Xie Jiu.

697
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:10,490
Xinyue Restaurant.

698
00:36:14,480 --> 00:36:16,900
There's no way Zhang Qishan brought Xie Jiu

699
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:18,690
to Beiping for just an auction.

700
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:22,650
Regardless of their plan,

701
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,650
Banjie Li must have asked to see me now

702
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:29,090
because it has something to do with their plan in Beiping.

703
00:36:30,630 --> 00:36:32,420
Sir, should we still see him then?

704
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,690
Of course.

705
00:36:35,630 --> 00:36:36,860
Banjie Li

706
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:39,570
is usually a selfish lone wolf.

707
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:42,780
This time, he asked to see me because of Zhang Qishan.

708
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:45,340
I'm curious

709
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:47,170
to see what he is up to.

710
00:36:50,510 --> 00:36:51,460
Cigarettes!

711
00:36:51,510 --> 00:36:52,210
Listen.

712
00:36:52,550 --> 00:36:53,960
[Liuchaoju Tea House]
Tell the owner

713
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:55,570
what I just told you.

714
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:57,460
You'll be able to close the deal.

715
00:36:57,960 --> 00:36:58,650
Are you sure?

716
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:00,050
Yes. Just trust me.

717
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:07,570
Officer Huo.

718
00:37:07,570 --> 00:37:08,680
Cigarettes!

719
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:10,520
Cigarettes!

720
00:37:20,320 --> 00:37:20,940
Officer Huo.

721
00:37:21,710 --> 00:37:22,340
Second floor, please.

722
00:37:35,510 --> 00:37:37,010
When did you return, Officer Huo?

723
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:41,460
Third Master, your men are everywhere.

724
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,920
I'm sure you were notified the moment

725
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:45,090
I stepped into Changsha City.

726
00:37:48,670 --> 00:37:49,940
You came back a long time ago,

727
00:37:50,670 --> 00:37:52,340
but you haven't visited the Huo Clan.

728
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:59,460
One

729
00:37:59,510 --> 00:38:00,940
should never forget his roots.

730
00:38:02,670 --> 00:38:03,690
What do you want from me?

731
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:05,420
Nothing.

732
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:08,130
Just catching up.

733
00:38:09,630 --> 00:38:10,460
You

734
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,090
have become so successful.

735
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,260
I wish to get some of your good luck.

736
00:38:16,670 --> 00:38:17,050
Come.

737
00:38:18,280 --> 00:38:20,860
I ordered the meal specially for you, Officer Huo.

738
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,050
Dig in.

739
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,740
Don't let me take up more of your time.

740
00:38:29,510 --> 00:38:29,980
Let's go.

741
00:38:38,840 --> 00:38:39,340
Oh.

742
00:38:42,670 --> 00:38:44,340
I almost forgot I have another gift for you.

743
00:38:50,670 --> 00:38:51,260
Keep it safe.

744
00:38:56,630 --> 00:38:57,050
Let's go.

745
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:07,740
Sir, are we still eating?

746
00:39:24,630 --> 00:39:26,090
Banjie Li is so arrogant.

747
00:39:26,630 --> 00:39:27,130
Sir.

748
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:28,690
He threatened you.

749
00:39:29,280 --> 00:39:30,650
I'll have him arrested now.

750
00:39:31,630 --> 00:39:33,650
Do you want me to die today or what?

751
00:39:34,630 --> 00:39:35,530
He stole my gun

752
00:39:35,550 --> 00:39:36,940
right under my nose.

753
00:39:37,150 --> 00:39:38,490
Killing me is just a piece of cake to him.

754
00:39:39,190 --> 00:39:40,740
Will he ever hurt someone from the Ministry of War though?

755
00:39:42,110 --> 00:39:43,130
Before this,

756
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:45,380
perhaps no.

757
00:39:46,110 --> 00:39:47,530
But what he did just now

758
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:50,050
implies

759
00:39:51,110 --> 00:39:51,980
that he's ready

760
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,650
to fight me to the death.

761
00:39:55,760 --> 00:39:56,690
Zhang Qishan.

762
00:39:58,920 --> 00:40:00,460
I don't know what he told the rest

763
00:40:00,630 --> 00:40:02,170
in the meeting last time.

764
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:04,380
But if the Mystic Nine is now

765
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:05,210
working together,

766
00:40:06,510 --> 00:40:07,980
we will have a terrible time

767
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,420
in Changsha.

768
00:40:09,710 --> 00:40:10,980
What should we do next?

769
00:40:16,550 --> 00:40:17,900
Forget about Beiping.

770
00:40:19,150 --> 00:40:20,780
Banjie Li will spy on us for sure.

771
00:40:22,230 --> 00:40:24,460
We might as well just play along and let them think

772
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:26,570
that we have given up.

773
00:40:27,230 --> 00:40:29,860
However, we can't sit around idly either.

774
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:31,300
If

775
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:33,420
the Mystic Nine is all intertwined like a knot,

776
00:40:34,030 --> 00:40:35,650
I'll just find another blade.

777
00:40:36,190 --> 00:40:37,530
Another blade

778
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,170
that can slice through the knot.

779
00:40:45,300 --> 00:40:48,040
[Hengyuantong Bank]

780
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:49,260
Make way.

781
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:50,460
We're all in the Mystic Nine,

782
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:51,690
but the Xie Clan sure is rich.

783
00:40:52,360 --> 00:40:53,210
Even though

784
00:40:53,230 --> 00:40:54,820
the money will belong to Xinyue Restaurant after tonight,

785
00:40:55,230 --> 00:40:55,940
in the end,

786
00:40:56,510 --> 00:40:58,050
it will still go to Master Zhang and his wife.

787
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:04,210
Master Zhang?

788
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:06,610
You shouldn't drive. That's beneath you.

789
00:41:06,670 --> 00:41:07,650
Come down now.

790
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:13,740
Master Zhang, you...

791
00:41:14,110 --> 00:41:14,940
Is there a problem?

792
00:41:17,070 --> 00:41:17,980
I was about to say

793
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,980
that with your current attire,

794
00:41:20,360 --> 00:41:21,170
you look

795
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:22,860
like a gentleman who studied

796
00:41:22,880 --> 00:41:24,490
in Japan for a few years.

797
00:41:26,630 --> 00:41:27,090
Eighth Master,

798
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:29,340
even if you're wearing an emperor's robe,

799
00:41:29,670 --> 00:41:31,610
you'll still look like a random performer

800
00:41:31,630 --> 00:41:32,460
in Second Master's opera.

801
00:41:34,590 --> 00:41:35,260
Stinky Yu.

802
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:37,380
Of all things you could have learned in Beiping,

803
00:41:37,630 --> 00:41:39,210
you learned how to insult others.

804
00:41:39,230 --> 00:41:39,900
Hop in.

805
00:41:41,320 --> 00:41:43,420
Master Zhang, it's time you change

806
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:44,900
your chauffeur.

807
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:46,090
For all you know,

808
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,740
he might bite someone else

809
00:41:48,670 --> 00:41:50,980
and you have to foot the medical bill.

810
00:41:57,110 --> 00:41:57,460
Master Zhang.

811
00:41:58,000 --> 00:41:59,130
You're wearing a changshan, not a military uniform.

812
00:42:00,230 --> 00:42:01,130
No need to be so uptight.

813
00:42:02,150 --> 00:42:03,050
Relax

814
00:42:03,510 --> 00:42:05,050
to display your suaveness.

815
00:42:07,150 --> 00:42:09,010
Speak for yourself, Xie Jiu.

816
00:42:09,960 --> 00:42:11,010
You have always

817
00:42:11,590 --> 00:42:12,780
been very cautious.

818
00:42:13,110 --> 00:42:14,690
But you're distraught today.

819
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:26,900
I haven't gone out for a while.

820
00:42:28,000 --> 00:42:28,900
The confinement of my residence

821
00:42:30,070 --> 00:42:30,940
has made me inattentive.

822
00:42:34,400 --> 00:42:34,980
Let me help you.

823
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:36,300
Master Zhang.

824
00:42:37,320 --> 00:42:38,980
Sixth Master and Fourth Master are both cranky.

825
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:40,690
Is it okay for them

826
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:41,860
to work together?

827
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:47,050
We'll find out soon.

828
00:42:47,660 --> 00:42:49,300
[World for Everyone]

829
00:42:54,300 --> 00:42:56,480
[Xinyue Restaurant]

830
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:57,420
Hi. Invitation letter, please.

831
00:42:59,280 --> 00:42:59,740
Thank you.

832
00:43:01,900 --> 00:43:10,420
[Beiping Branch of the Military Affairs Commission]

833
00:43:14,400 --> 00:43:14,940
Welcome.

834
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:15,860
Come.

835
00:43:15,860 --> 00:43:20,580
[Yahe Monthly]

836
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:53,170
Beiping's Opium King, Tian Zuocheng, proof of funds, approved.

837
00:43:57,400 --> 00:44:00,940
Jiangxi's Vinegar Tycoon, Xiong Lichang, proof of funds, approved.

838
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:17,300
Hello.

839
00:44:22,710 --> 00:44:26,780
Liang Bencai of Yahe Monthly, proof of funds, approved.

840
00:44:41,500 --> 00:44:42,500
[Xinyue Restaurant]

841
00:44:42,510 --> 00:44:44,940
This is almost identical to Xinyue Restaurant.

842
00:44:46,670 --> 00:44:48,420
Even though it's the Military Affairs Commission,

843
00:44:49,320 --> 00:44:50,690
the interior of it is directly taken

844
00:44:50,710 --> 00:44:52,740
from Xinyue Restaurant.

845
00:44:53,510 --> 00:44:55,170
If there is war,

846
00:44:55,280 --> 00:44:58,130
can the entire building be moved to another province?

847
00:44:59,230 --> 00:45:00,780
Only a few know how to dismantle

848
00:45:01,400 --> 00:45:03,260
and assemble it.

849
00:45:14,110 --> 00:45:16,820
The ones over there are from Kinmen Shipping.

850
00:45:17,670 --> 00:45:19,740
They prospect gold in Nanyang.

851
00:45:20,800 --> 00:45:22,340
The one with the hat

852
00:45:22,920 --> 00:45:24,380
is the biggest medicine supplier in Fengtian.

853
00:45:25,110 --> 00:45:26,940
To our right, the father and son duo

854
00:45:27,550 --> 00:45:29,530
are the Dongs from Jiangyou's Saltery.

855
00:45:31,030 --> 00:45:32,610
All of the visitors here

856
00:45:32,960 --> 00:45:35,530
are no ordinary folk.

857
00:45:36,590 --> 00:45:37,900
They are individual bidders.

858
00:45:39,070 --> 00:45:41,690
The powerful ones are in the private cabins.

859
00:45:42,360 --> 00:45:43,010
Follow me.

860
00:45:44,800 --> 00:45:46,690
Their guards are very strong.

861
00:45:46,840 --> 00:45:48,610
Almost as strong as the Mystic Nine.

862
00:46:09,800 --> 00:46:10,780
I heard

863
00:46:11,150 --> 00:46:11,980
there are many

864
00:46:12,000 --> 00:46:13,980
rare gems in the auction today.

865
00:46:14,670 --> 00:46:16,010
Miss Huo, pick anything you like.

866
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:17,940
Don't worry about the budget.

867
00:46:19,480 --> 00:46:20,420
Mr. Tottori,

868
00:46:20,440 --> 00:46:22,340
are you planning to seize

869
00:46:22,880 --> 00:46:24,380
every treasure from my nation?

870
00:46:25,480 --> 00:46:26,610
You have the wrong idea, Miss Huo.

871
00:46:27,510 --> 00:46:28,380
The Japanese

872
00:46:28,960 --> 00:46:31,820
want to be friends with everyone in Asia.

873
00:46:32,550 --> 00:46:35,980
Instead of letting these relics be destroyed in war

874
00:46:36,710 --> 00:46:38,260
or thrown away by those who don't know

875
00:46:38,440 --> 00:46:39,460
to appreciate them,

876
00:46:41,070 --> 00:46:42,570
they are much safer

877
00:46:43,230 --> 00:46:44,380
in our hands.

878
00:46:47,440 --> 00:46:48,010
Let's go up.

879
00:47:12,960 --> 00:47:13,530
Chief Editor Liang.

880
00:47:13,760 --> 00:47:15,400
These are the gold bars as exchanged with your assets.

881
00:47:15,590 --> 00:47:17,740
After the auction, you can exchange the remainder for silver certificates.

882
00:47:19,180 --> 00:47:21,180
[Private Room One]

883
00:47:37,960 --> 00:47:38,490
Miss Huo,

884
00:47:38,880 --> 00:47:40,010
the chief auctioneer prepared

885
00:47:40,070 --> 00:47:41,340
this fruit platter for you.

886
00:47:41,710 --> 00:47:42,650
Much appreciated. Put it there.

887
00:47:46,510 --> 00:47:47,260
Mr. Tottori.

888
00:48:06,190 --> 00:48:06,780
Miss Huo.

889
00:48:08,000 --> 00:48:09,010
What is the meaning of this?

890
00:48:09,630 --> 00:48:10,980
I'm the consultant you hired.

891
00:48:11,840 --> 00:48:12,650
Not your female companion.

892
00:48:21,760 --> 00:48:22,380
I can view

893
00:48:22,400 --> 00:48:24,210
the auction items better from this angle.

894
00:48:25,590 --> 00:48:28,490
Miss Huo, your tie with Xinyue Restaurant

895
00:48:29,110 --> 00:48:30,420
runs deeper than I thought.

896
00:48:31,510 --> 00:48:32,420
So you...

897
00:48:47,400 --> 00:48:48,490
In today's auction,

898
00:48:49,230 --> 00:48:51,340
other than us, there is also

899
00:48:51,760 --> 00:48:53,900
Chief Editor of Yahe Monthly, Liang Bencai.

900
00:48:54,230 --> 00:48:55,780
To avoid overspending,

901
00:48:55,920 --> 00:48:57,050
we need a strategy.

902
00:48:57,230 --> 00:48:59,490
I'll invite him over later.

903
00:49:00,190 --> 00:49:01,340
You can talk to him.

904
00:49:01,800 --> 00:49:02,690
We'll do as you wish.

905
00:49:11,030 --> 00:49:12,210
The security here is tight.

906
00:49:12,670 --> 00:49:14,530
No one can do anything recklessly.

907
00:49:14,760 --> 00:49:16,740
I hope everything goes well later.

908
00:49:18,760 --> 00:49:19,530
Mr. Liang,

909
00:49:19,800 --> 00:49:21,740
Mr. Torii Tottori of Private Room 1

910
00:49:21,800 --> 00:49:22,940
invites you for a chat.

911
00:49:23,150 --> 00:49:25,010
He wants to introduce a new friend to you.

912
00:49:25,840 --> 00:49:26,820
Mr. Tottori?

913
00:49:27,360 --> 00:49:29,300
What is he doing here?

914
00:49:29,480 --> 00:49:31,130
I'm not sure.

915
00:49:34,400 --> 00:49:36,210
I should've checked my fortune before I left.

916
00:49:36,230 --> 00:49:37,780
I can't believe Torii Tottori is here.

917
00:49:38,110 --> 00:49:39,010
He wants to see you.

918
00:49:39,230 --> 00:49:40,570
We can only leave now.

919
00:49:41,550 --> 00:49:42,300
Or,

920
00:49:43,150 --> 00:49:44,570
Torii Tottori

921
00:49:44,920 --> 00:49:46,090
has never

922
00:49:46,710 --> 00:49:48,010
met Liang Bencai before.

923
00:49:50,230 --> 00:49:52,460
Liang Bencai is just a lowly chief editor

924
00:49:52,760 --> 00:49:53,610
of a fake monthly magazine.

925
00:49:53,960 --> 00:49:56,780
It's possible that they have never met each other.

926
00:49:57,710 --> 00:49:58,780
And if they have?

927
00:50:02,150 --> 00:50:03,860
If they have met each other before,

928
00:50:04,480 --> 00:50:06,090
I'll have to kill Torii Tottori.

929
00:50:06,840 --> 00:50:07,940
If a high-ranking Japanese officer

930
00:50:08,030 --> 00:50:09,490
is killed in the Military Affairs Commission,

931
00:50:09,960 --> 00:50:11,260
that will be a diplomatic crisis.

932
00:50:11,710 --> 00:50:14,690
I don't want to implicate Xinyue restaurant in this.

933
00:50:15,440 --> 00:50:17,610
I'll bear the consequences alone.

934
00:50:18,030 --> 00:50:18,820
It seems like

935
00:50:20,480 --> 00:50:21,980
you'll have to meet him.

936
00:50:46,380 --> 00:50:50,540
♪The past fades like smoke♪

937
00:50:50,900 --> 00:50:53,620
♪A choice is made in silence♪

938
00:50:53,900 --> 00:50:56,700
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

939
00:50:57,100 --> 00:51:00,860
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

940
00:51:01,100 --> 00:51:04,540
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

941
00:51:04,820 --> 00:51:08,220
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

942
00:51:08,300 --> 00:51:15,580
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

943
00:51:16,020 --> 00:51:19,300
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

944
00:51:19,580 --> 00:51:22,820
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

945
00:51:22,980 --> 00:51:27,020
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

946
00:51:27,220 --> 00:51:30,580
♪Who believes in fate?♪

947
00:51:30,820 --> 00:51:34,180
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

948
00:51:34,420 --> 00:51:37,700
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

949
00:51:38,020 --> 00:51:41,700
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

950
00:51:41,900 --> 00:51:45,140
♪Take care♪

951
00:51:45,140 --> 00:51:47,700
♪We once raced♪

952
00:51:47,780 --> 00:51:49,700
♪For the dawn♪

953
00:51:49,860 --> 00:51:53,140
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

954
00:51:53,260 --> 00:51:56,540
♪In the web of fate♪

955
00:51:56,540 --> 00:51:59,740
♪No one can escape♪

956
00:52:00,740 --> 00:52:02,580
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

957
00:52:02,740 --> 00:52:04,300
♪We too were young once♪

958
00:52:04,380 --> 00:52:07,820
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

959
00:52:08,020 --> 00:52:10,340
♪Keep the ember lit♪

960
00:52:10,460 --> 00:52:14,980
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

961
00:52:15,100 --> 00:52:18,060
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

962
00:52:18,300 --> 00:52:21,820
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

963
00:52:21,940 --> 00:52:25,700
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

964
00:52:26,020 --> 00:52:29,500
♪Who believes in fate?♪

965
00:52:29,660 --> 00:52:32,660
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

966
00:52:32,900 --> 00:52:36,660
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

967
00:52:36,820 --> 00:52:40,540
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

968
00:52:40,660 --> 00:52:52,100
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
